OL,3,GNEWSARival fans split over derby-day
OL,4,A'bubble'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRival football fans are split over
OL,7,Fpolice measures designed to keep
OL,8,Fsupporters separated for the first
OL,9,Fsouth coast derby of the season.
OL,11,FThe match between Southampton and
OL,12,FPortsmouth at St Mary's at midday on
OL,13,FSunday, saw supporters required to
OL,14,Ftravel under a tightly controlled
OL,15,F"bubble" system overseen by Hampshire
OL,16,FPolice.
OL,18,FUnder the arrangements, Pompey fans
OL,19,Fhave only been allowed to attend if
OL,20,Fthey travelled on an official coach
OL,21,Ffrom Fratton Park.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
