OL,3,GNEWSARival fans split over derby-day
OL,4,A'bubble'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe clubs agreed to continue the coach
OL,7,Ftravel scheme used last season, with
OL,8,Fpolice saying before the game that it
OL,9,Fwould help ensure the safe arrival and
OL,10,Fdeparture of all supporters.
